# AI rules merged from 5 web sources and the AI category in 分流规则.zip
# Generated: 2026-10-15 (Asia/Shanghai)
# Exact duplicates and domain rules covered by retained suffixes removed.
# Shared-service keywords and original IP/ASN rules preserved.
# GEOSITE and IP-ASN require compatible converter/client and databases.
# General NTP category excluded: not AI-specific.
# Sources:
# https://github.com/viewer12/OverseasAI.list
# https://github.com/cnsiming/ProxyRules/tree/main
# https://ip.net.coffee/claude/site.html
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ACL4SSR/ACL4SSR/master/Clash/Ruleset/OpenAi.list
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/refs/heads/master/rule/Clash/Gemini/Gemini.list
# Local source: 分流规则.zip / Egress-Application-Rules.list / 人工智能与 AI 工具
# OverseasAI includes GPL-2.0 material; see AI-LICENSE.txt and original source.
# Rules: 507
# 本版按应用或网站分段；规则集合与 AI.list 完全一致，共 507 条。
# 分组用于整理来源，不表示已独立核实每个域名归属或可用性。
# “网站：域名”表示单独列示该网站，未将其强行归入其他品牌。
# 共享服务单独分组，每条规则只保留一次。注释标题不会创建客户端策略组。

